{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "0982b6b3-6ace-5a81-810a-355246ae2ae1", "source_ordinal": 2534, "reading_ordinal": 1519, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "夜场路", "published_at": "2022-11-07T03:52:12+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/555950640/answer/2747430184"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有一点荒唐的妄想，害了无数的人。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "就是认为堕落比努力简单，偏门比正道容易。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "好像只要自己一放弃原则坚持，抛弃社会所倡导的正道，立刻就能换到真金白银，可以解决经济问题。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 83}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这里先不讨论同样这样想的人有多少、导致这条路本身有多激烈的竞争——捞偏门也是讲专业的，以为肯走偏门就可以不用努力，实在是想得太美了。", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "拿刀砍人也是要练的，练得不好可不是罚站。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 171}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "伺候大爷也是要学的，学得不好结果可不是请家长。", "char_start": 172, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "就说那些凌辱、轻蔑、强迫、要挟乃至直接的肉体折磨，每一样都比背单词、看开发手册、考证痛苦得多。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 243}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而且一经陷入，就由不得你想走就走。", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "随便拍你几张照、录点视频，瞟你一眼身份证，你这辈子都别想再和ta们脱离干系。", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 301}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "任何时候打电话你都要接，要你做什么事你都要做。", "char_start": 302, "char_end": 325}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不然你可以试一下。", "char_start": 326, "char_end": 335}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你试明白了，知道后果了，桌上这包你就吸下去。", "char_start": 336, "char_end": 358}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "以后老老实实，不要再有什么不恰当的想法。", "char_start": 359, "char_end": 379}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "我们出来混也是求财，不是求气。你帮我赚钱，我自然不会亏待你。", "char_start": 380, "char_end": 410}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "何况，你以为你还可以过回以前的日子吗？", "char_start": 411, "char_end": 430}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "我就是不拦着你，你可以自己去试试，看看你是不是再也遇不到光顾过你的客人，看看你还能不能跟小仙女一样谈个恋爱，找个老实人嫁。", "char_start": 431, "char_end": 492}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "随便撞到个熟客，ta一句话都能毁灭你的美好新生活。", "char_start": 493, "char_end": 518}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "到时候你要出什么价换ta不开口？", "char_start": 519, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "与其在沙滩上提心吊胆、自欺欺人的盖海市蜃楼，何不如在这里安心做？", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 568}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "将来攒一笔钱，钱存在自己户头里，也就不在乎谁发现、谁看不起了。", "char_start": 569, "char_end": 600}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "所以这其实是为你着想。", "char_start": 601, "char_end": 612}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "下手重了点，将来你会感谢我的。", "char_start": 613, "char_end": 628}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这是一万，拿去调养身体，你休息一个星期，回来上班。", "char_start": 629, "char_end": 654}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "你休息完一个星期，回来还会对你“委以重任”。你干完了，就不谈什么社死了，查查刑法基本上也三年起步了，你也就确实没啥念想了。", "char_start": 655, "char_end": 716}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "真心奉劝你，编程、英语、财务、护理……没那么难学。", "char_start": 718, "char_end": 743}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "枯燥、复杂要比折磨、要挟好熬一万倍。", "char_start": 744, "char_end": 762}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 28}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0235"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：想去夜场上班，可以劝劝我吗?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“夜场路”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有一点荒唐的妄想，害了无数的人。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有一点荒唐的妄想，害了无数的人。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c4270c77-1055-568d-9919-ad59078c3a90", "source_ordinal": 2533, "reading_ordinal": 1520, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "晚了两步", "published_at": "2022-11-09T05:26:57+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/269222429/answer/2750424520"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "问题不是追求“外在美”，而是在追求“形象被大众认可”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "形象被大众认可，并不等于外在美。", "char_start": 28, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "很遗憾的是——大众并不知道什么是美。他们往往并不认同真正的美，而是在认同ta们个人心目中的“大家关于美的观点”。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "也就是说，大众只是在循着自己对共识的想象在从众。", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而一般被称为“追求外在美”的行为，实际上根本与美没啥关系，而是一种在外貌领域的从众——甚至是媚俗——行为。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 180}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "真正的问题不是要不要追求外在美，而是要不要在外貌领域上从众、媚俗。", "char_start": 181, "char_end": 214}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这是两个完全不同的——甚至经常是南辕北辙的方向。", "char_start": 215, "char_end": 239}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "南辕北辙到什么程度呢？", "char_start": 240, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "前者研究的是服装学、美妆理论、色彩理论，然后根据对理论的领悟形成自己的看法，通过这些东西原创外貌方案。这些人追求的是自身的方案和自身的表达的逻辑统一。", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这个很像古典音乐、格律诗的创作，是有内部的美学理论的。", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 355}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "后者关注的却是大众情报。今年流行什么，明年流行什么，偶像穿戴什么，明星装扮什么。", "char_start": 357, "char_end": 397}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "说白了，就是在“尽力模仿点击量最大的方案”。", "char_start": 398, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这不叫“追求外在美”，而叫做趋炎附势。", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "从一开始，就是对自己的人格的抛弃，是从骨子里流露出的软弱和恐惧。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 473}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "追求外在美——或者任何意义上的美——都是一种对世界真理的深刻的追求。", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这种追求本身就是最高的崇敬，是一种宗教性的虔敬行为。", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这是只对真理、对世界的奥秘负责的。是当事人与世界和历史之间的交往。", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 569}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这永远是好事、幸事，没有任何必要作丝毫的犹豫，不需要囿于任何庸人的愚见。", "char_start": 570, "char_end": 606}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "对这作任何攻击，都自动的将攻击者自身定义为蠢人。", "char_start": 607, "char_end": 631}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "这一点，不受任何反驳。", "char_start": 632, "char_end": 643}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "但是趋炎附势这种事——无论多么隐蔽——追根到底是一场幻梦。", "char_start": 645, "char_end": 674}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "因为你花了极大力气所趋附的对象自身就像一只小老鼠靠着烛光投在墙上的巨影，只不过是一个脆弱的幻像。", "char_start": 675, "char_end": 723}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "你以为它可以力拔山兮气盖世，其实等你献祭完毕，要求赐福的时候，你会发现它其实连蜡烛的火焰都举不起来。", "char_start": 724, "char_end": 774}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "可笑的是，其实“大众的共识”只是对创造者们创造的杰作征服之后的结果。大众的共识本来就已经晚了一步，趋附者们再去追随晚了一步的东西，自己足足晚了两步。", "char_start": 776, "char_end": 850}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "晚了两步，黄花菜都凉了。", "char_start": 851, "char_end": 863}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你是在纠结要不要努力追求晚两步吗？", "char_start": 864, "char_end": 881}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 30}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0235"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：追求外在美是一种虚荣的表现吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026"], "summary": "围绕“晚了两步”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“问题不是追求“外在美”，而是在追求“形象被大众认可”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "问题不是追求“外在美”，而是在追求“形象被大众认可”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 27, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "03d09ea4-001e-5cb4-9bde-37d0fa9d45db", "source_ordinal": 2532, "reading_ordinal": 1521, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "见龙在田", "published_at": "2022-11-09T22:35:52+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/55061712/answer/2751675016"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "看不到未来方向的时候，就练那些万能基本功、攒那些万用资源。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "比如锻炼身体，无论明天发生什么，有好身体总是更好。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "比如多交点朋友，无论明天要发生什么，多点朋友总是好事。", "char_start": 57, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "比如多学点知识，无论明天发生什么，多点知识总是好的。", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "比如提高表达能力，无论明天发生什么，有好口才总是更好。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 139}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "比如多攒点钱，无论明天发生什么，多攒点钱总是好的。", "char_start": 140, "char_end": 165}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "比如多解开些积怨，无论明天发生什么，少个仇人总是好的。", "char_start": 166, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "其实再明确也不过了。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 204}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "一个人说“不知道明天应该干嘛了”，其实根本就是没有道理的。不知道干嘛了，那么上面任何一样都可以干。除了这些，你触类旁通一下，还有不知道多少这类万能之事可以干。", "char_start": 205, "char_end": 284}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "反过来，还有一半，就是那些“无论干啥都不该干的事”——比如不吃不喝、酗酒吸毒、挑拨离间、蜚短流长、阴阳怪气、坑蒙拐骗……——就尽量少干、不干。", "char_start": 285, "char_end": 356}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "有方向去奔，那就去奔；方向、目标幻灭了，那就回到这个“固本培元”的默认方向上来。", "char_start": 357, "char_end": 397}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "根本没什么需要迷茫的，一秒钟也不必浪费。", "char_start": 398, "char_end": 418}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "上九，亢龙有悔——玩脱了，这下知道后悔了。", "char_start": 420, "char_end": 441}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "初九，潜龙勿用——老实蹲着，不要乱动。这时候又搞啥卫星项目去“挽回面子”，一般都是作死。", "char_start": 442, "char_end": 486}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "九二，见龙在田——固本培元，把那些根本的东西弄弄好。基础能力增长了，一些原本你做不到的事你可以做到了，新路自然就出来了。", "char_start": 487, "char_end": 547}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "九五，飞龙在天——时候到了，有你飞的。", "char_start": 548, "char_end": 567}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0235"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎样才能在看不见未来的方向时，继续前行？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“见龙在田”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“看不到未来方向的时候，就练那些万能基本功、攒那些万用资源。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "看不到未来方向的时候，就练那些万能基本功、攒那些万用资源。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "69fa13cd-e634-593f-b0eb-4a589375e77c", "source_ordinal": 2531, "reading_ordinal": 1522, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "回家种地", "published_at": "2022-11-10T15:18:12+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/308217192/answer/2752582222"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "现在种地是一门相当复杂的技术活。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "建议先学一下农学专业，还要专门学一学你要种植的品种的专业知识。", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你会开农机么？你知道这一个周期要用到哪几种农机吗？为了用这些农机，地块要怎么分割你知道吗？", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你会用无人机么？", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 103}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你知道各种种子的偏好和特性么？", "char_start": 104, "char_end": 119}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你知道产品销售的渠道有哪些么？", "char_start": 120, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "知道有哪些惠农政策和扶植项目么？", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 152}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "坦率讲，这么繁杂而专业的任务，没有几个人合伙是很难支撑的，所以现代农业基本变成了大型农户合作组织或者干脆就是农户提供土地给专业农企统一管理。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 224}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "不然你很难竞争得过这些对手，种出来的东西产量不稳定、品质不整齐。", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "现在人家收果子最好是要你自己先按品质规格分好的。如果你都混在一起，人家还要再收你一笔分拣费。如果你田间管理不好，一片田里长出三个等级甚至四个等级，基本上你会亏死。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 339}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这还不谈产量稀烂这类更要命的问题。", "char_start": 340, "char_end": 357}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "当然，你纯种给自己吃除外。", "char_start": 358, "char_end": 371}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "现在一切都需要功夫，对这个不要有任何侥幸。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 394}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "没有功夫，就老老实实给人打下手，别谈钱的事。", "char_start": 395, "char_end": 417}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "就酱。", "char_start": 418, "char_end": 421}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0235"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：想回家种地，有没有什么建议？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“回家种地”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“现在种地是一门相当复杂的技术活。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "现在种地是一门相当复杂的技术活。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "e8835ad8-dfc9-5c23-b9a8-7043fff1f001", "source_ordinal": 2530, "reading_ordinal": 1523, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "宽严相济", "published_at": "2022-11-12T01:27:54+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/566049818/answer/2754761093"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "今天讲一下这个重要的政治哲学观念，对你踩准中国社会的主脉搏很关键。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "——宽严相济。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这可不是只拿来对对联用的，而是正式出现在中国的政策文件上的专用术语。", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 76}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "《最高人民法院关于贯彻宽严相济刑事政策的若干意见》的理解与适用 - 中华人民共和国最高人民法院什么叫宽严相济？基本上是这样一种朴素的方法论——如果你想放宽什么，一定意味着你要对应的抓紧某些东西。", "char_start": 77, "char_end": 174}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你要放松量刑额度，那么你就要提高起诉效率。", "char_start": 175, "char_end": 196}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "对应的，你要放松封控频率，那么你就要严格管理核酸检测和核酸码验证。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一些人发这些东西似乎是要唱衰，要高唱“封控又增强了，经济很悲观”，其实这是对中国缺乏了解的结果。", "char_start": 231, "char_end": 279}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "最近在高喊保守使用静态封控、在回收静态封控的决策权到更高层级。", "char_start": 280, "char_end": 311}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这是宽，", "char_start": 312, "char_end": 316}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这就必定意味着在对称的方面一定会加倍的严。", "char_start": 317, "char_end": 338}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "有接待性质的业务，最近一定要老老实实，后面很可能会建立核酸码的暗访制度。随机抽查核酸检测和核酸放行检验。", "char_start": 339, "char_end": 391}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "全国各地都可能会抓一批随随便便、虚应故事的核酸检测点、社区、店铺来做范例，惩罚的力度可能会很大。", "char_start": 392, "char_end": 440}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "要借这些案例传递一些信息。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这是好消息，是中国转向开放的实质性步骤。换句话来说，这些消息对市场是很大的利好消息。", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 497}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "严格核酸和核验，是开放和维持开放的绝对逻辑前提。最近——实际上包括以后——都不要心怀侥幸，以免撞枪口。", "char_start": 498, "char_end": 549}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "类似擅自偷越封控边界被学校开除、核酸作弊被开除公职、核酸检测服务不规范被重罚、核酸码核验不严格被勒令停业整改、冒充身份混过防疫关卡被判刑……都会渐渐见怪不怪，成为平常事。", "char_start": 550, "char_end": 635}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "斩鸡头不见得是要喝黄酒，还有可能是要给猴子看。", "char_start": 636, "char_end": 659}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0235"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：国务院联防联控机制表示逐一排查校园随意封控、封控时间过长等突出问题并督促整改，目前各地情况如何？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“宽严相济”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“今天讲一下这个重要的政治哲学观念，对你踩准中国社会的主脉搏很关键。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "今天讲一下这个重要的政治哲学观念，对你踩准中国社会的主脉搏很关键。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 33, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "060f0fbb-703f-5175-952b-c86b1a949fbb", "source_ordinal": 2529, "reading_ordinal": 1524, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "反敌意监控", "published_at": "2022-11-12T16:40:46+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/477274156/answer/2755493771"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "被跟踪监视，不要傻呆呆坐在家里。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这不是给对方制造监控你的方便吗？", "char_start": 17, "char_end": 33}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "任何事情都是经济账，让监控的人破产就行了。", "char_start": 34, "char_end": 55}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "1）多出入难以监控的场合，充分制造跟踪成本。", "char_start": 56, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "周末多出去玩，地点临时决定，今天挖土豆、下周摘草莓。没事多坐地下铁，临近关门再上下车。一时兴起去漂流，心血来潮奔海南，复兴高铁和谐号，半路下车到湖南。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 154}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "跟踪小队跑断腿，想想都要笑哈哈。", "char_start": 155, "char_end": 171}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "干脆再找个要经常出差的工作，你是公费出行，ta们是私人出资。你因公出境去印尼，他们还要想办法对付“非必要不出境”。", "char_start": 172, "char_end": 229}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "2）多参与人际交往，隔三差五交新朋友，多参加饭局酒局。", "char_start": 230, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "遮住嘴巴贴耳聊，小声说话大声笑，急得对手哇哇叫。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "每天你的接触名单都有一胳膊长，让ta们去猜你跟谁说了什么，去调查各种潜在知情人的背景实力和威胁。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "看累不死ta们。", "char_start": 332, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这类思路稍微打开一点，你就会发现在手上没有公权力，不能充分调动国家机器的前提下，想靠私人的资源监视一个自由人，在被对方主动察觉的前提下，经济上基本上是不可承受的。", "char_start": 341, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "每天成本至少都要十几万，否则轻轻松松就会被摆脱甚至会被反制——会被对方抓到把柄把跟踪的人送进去。", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 471}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0235"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：被有组织纠缠，被一群人跟踪滋扰，盯梢监视。怎么才能摆脱他们啊？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“反敌意监控”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“被跟踪监视，不要傻呆呆坐在家里。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "被跟踪监视，不要傻呆呆坐在家里。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 16, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c920fa88-3a12-561f-a38e-1c791edbb355", "source_ordinal": 2528, "reading_ordinal": 1525, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "以爱为名", "published_at": "2022-11-12T22:29:02+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/566063675/answer/2755899248"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么叫做“为了爱”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "我当然不反对人维护自己的契约利益——维护自己的利益本来就是理所应当的，甚至坦白讲，你所认定的利益是否得到别人的认可、你维护利益的手段是否被别人接受，这都不影响你的天然权利。", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 97}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你有天然的权利以任何你做得到的方式维护一切你认为值得维护的权利，这是自然界天然给你的许可，这用不着纠结。", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "之所以以法律为界，是因为违反了法律会客观上扩大风险和局限，在成本、风险和收益上不划算。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 194}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而所谓以道德为界，不是指以其他什么张三李四的道德标准为界，是以你自己的道德标准为界。", "char_start": 195, "char_end": 237}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这没什么可羞愧、可惶恐的。", "char_start": 238, "char_end": 251}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "但是，是为了自己的利益而做就是为了自己的利益而做，不要扯虎皮、不要做大旗。", "char_start": 252, "char_end": 289}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "为了自己的利益已经足够正当了，不要自己心虚志短，好像“自己的利益”还不够分量，再东拉西扯搞一堆大义名分，这只会让人感觉底气虚弱、惊惶软弱。", "char_start": 290, "char_end": 359}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这件事只是和恋情有关，坦白说谈不上什么“为爱”。", "char_start": 361, "char_end": 385}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "不要以为谈恋爱就一定和爱有关，那只是双方主观上觉得自己是在求爱。", "char_start": 386, "char_end": 418}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "相当一部分人只是在胡搞瞎搞，是把一堆别的乱七八糟的东西挂上了爱的名字，只是“以爱为名”，其实根本就跟爱没有关系。", "char_start": 419, "char_end": 475}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "“以爱为名”和“为爱”之间差着十万八千里，就像“以民主自由为名”和“为了民主自由”之间的差距一样。", "char_start": 476, "char_end": 525}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0235"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：男子骑车三天三夜为爱翻墙进学校被保安狂追，被称为「为爱冲锋的勇士」，校方回应系感情纠纷，如何评价此事？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“以爱为名”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么叫做“为了爱”？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么叫做“为了爱”？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1beb2c0f-6bb5-5905-93a4-18e413503d98", "source_ordinal": 2527, "reading_ordinal": 1526, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "影武者", "published_at": "2022-11-13T02:57:51+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/333334192/answer/2756108907"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "为什么要对这位女子冷嘲热讽？因为这样可以“威吓”打算移民的人？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "“威吓”来干什么？", "char_start": 32, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "为了不让“本帮”流失人力资源？或者，性资源？", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 64}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "当你对人采取敌意立场的时候，先审视一下自己的敌意情绪，到底是为什么。", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "不要总是尝试靠当谁的敌人去解决问题，这是人格发育不健全、智商不足的表现。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "迷信暴力大棒，首先就意味着无能——因为说穿了这是因为没能力创造出足够的价值，没有用输出价值解决问题的习惯而养成的反向的适应。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 199}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "迷信大棒已经够糟糕了，要是迷信的大棒本身就是幻影，根本就没有分量，那简直是可悲、可怜。", "char_start": 200, "char_end": 243}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这会瞬间让人对你丧失信心，更别提谈什么女朋友了。", "char_start": 244, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "女孩子们不一定能说清为什么，但是凭直觉就会对你这些行为感到强烈的厌恶和鄙视。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 307}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "其实那是凭直觉体会到了你的懦弱和无能。", "char_start": 308, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "说实在的，光是停止散发组这种“弱而暴戾”的气息，你的人生体验都会比现在好很多。", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "关键是你自己要对这种事敏感——越是弱人，越会认同暴力，会抓住机会珍惜自己手里仅存的暴力，甚至会贪恋“口嗨”这类暴力的幻影。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 429}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这是一种极大的羞耻，对这个一定要敏感。", "char_start": 430, "char_end": 449}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为别人——那些轻松就能创造价值，习惯于用价值解决问题的人对此会很敏感。", "char_start": 450, "char_end": 486}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "而真正的武力、实力、权力其实是专属于这类人的。", "char_start": 487, "char_end": 510}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你真的想要位高权重、令人敬畏，就要停止搞这些低级的上不了台盘的蠢事，否则你这是南辕北辙，缘木求鱼，越是在网上耀武扬威，离真正的影响力越远。", "char_start": 511, "char_end": 580}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "越玩越弱，越凶越可怜。", "char_start": 581, "char_end": 592}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "人家回避你、应付你，根本不是因为尊敬你，更不是怕你，而是因为嫌你。", "char_start": 593, "char_end": 626}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "早点醒悟吧，", "char_start": 627, "char_end": 633}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "申请恢复中国国籍_办事指南_中国政府网", "char_start": 634, "char_end": 653}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 20}, "divergence": true, "divergence_count": 1}, "text_lexical_divergence": [{"reason": "text_tail_not_in_lexical", "paragraph_kind": "tail", "char_start": 634, "sample": "申请恢复中国国籍_办事指南_中国政府网"}]}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0235"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价网上的伊朗籍二十二岁妇女嫁给伊朗人，现在又想去中国却回不来?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“影武者”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“为什么要对这位女子冷嘲热讽？因为这样可以“威吓”打算移民的人？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "为什么要对这位女子冷嘲热讽？因为这样可以“威吓”打算移民的人？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 31, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
